LOGBOOK.md:941:- CAPABILITY: TCP, safe DNS, UDP, route mode, route-installed state, and health are independent required facts with no full-mode bit. Unknown output lifecycle/route values project to `unknown` with every capability false; generation/sequence ordering rejects lower generations and non-increasing snapshots.
